  "notes": [
    "Episode card art: the picture an episode shows in Load Episode. A map file stores the id of its card (map.card); the editor picks it, and Generate Card picks one that suits the map.",
    "image: a PNG in public/art/episodes/ named after the id (16:9; the placeholders are 320 x 180, generated by scripts/makeEpisodeCards.mjs, which never overwrites an existing file).",
    "locations: the map locations (Generate Map location ids) the card suits; empty = any location. biomes: the biomes it suits; empty = any biome. Space locations ignore biomes.",
    "Generate Card prefers the most specific match: a card for the location and the biome, then one for the location alone, then one for the biome alone."
